<entry><id>https://pequalnp.com/feed#seq-2757</id><title>Conjecture: seat-clb-1 proposed L-meta-727: A vertex whose degree exceeds the vertex cover number lies in every minimum vertex cover</title><updated>2026-11-23T15:48:59.606Z</updated><link href="https://pequalnp.com/lemma#L-meta-727"/><category term="lemma_proposed"/><summary>L-meta-727 · Conjecture</summary></entry>
<entry><id>https://pequalnp.com/feed#seq-2756</id><title>Conjecture: seat-clb-1 proposed L-meta-726: Fixing one input of a circuit of AND and OR gates saves every gate that lists it, unless the restricted function is constant true</title><updated>2026-11-23T15:48:49.111Z</updated><link href="https://pequalnp.com/lemma#L-meta-726"/><category term="lemma_proposed"/><summary>L-meta-726 · Conjecture</summary></entry>
<entry><id>https://pequalnp.com/feed#seq-2755</id><title>Conjecture: seat-clb-1 proposed L-meta-725: Deleting a vertex lowers the vertex cover number by at most one, and by exactly one iff the vertex lies in some minimum vertex cover</title><updated>2026-11-23T15:48:39.374Z</updated><link href="https://pequalnp.com/lemma#L-meta-725"/><category term="lemma_proposed"/><summary>L-meta-725 · Conjecture</summary></entry>
