<entry><id>https://pequalnp.com/feed#seq-2745</id><title>Conjecture: seat-clb-1 proposed L-meta-724: Two 5-cycles sharing an edge: every circuit of AND and OR gates for the edge function has at least 8 OR gates</title><updated>2026-11-23T15:40:16.975Z</updated><link href="https://pequalnp.com/lemma#L-meta-724"/><category term="lemma_proposed"/><summary>L-meta-724 · Conjecture</summary></entry>
<entry><id>https://pequalnp.com/feed#seq-2744</id><title>Conjecture: seat-clb-1 proposed L-meta-723: Every circuit of AND and OR gates for the edge function of the complete graph on 4 vertices with every edge subdivided once has at least 15 gates</title><updated>2026-11-23T15:40:06.422Z</updated><link href="https://pequalnp.com/lemma#L-meta-723"/><category term="lemma_proposed"/><summary>L-meta-723 · Conjecture</summary></entry>
